;; fixture — beancount-reconcile eval22 (commodity printed beyond two decimals)
option "operating_currency" "USD"

2026-04-01 open Assets:Crypto:Wallet BTC
2026-04-01 open Expenses:Food:Groceries
2026-04-01 open Equity:Opening-Balances

2026-04-30 * "Opening"
  Assets:Crypto:Wallet   0.010000 BTC
  Equity:Opening-Balances

2026-05-01 balance Assets:Crypto:Wallet   0.010000 BTC

2026-05-11 * "COFFEE BY LIGHTNING"
  Assets:Crypto:Wallet   -0.000425 BTC
  Expenses:Food:Groceries  0.000425 BTC
